# Elven Passage: the search may find nothing (no basic land in the library, CR 701.23b); "You may behold an Elf" still
# happens, since it is not part of the land's arrival: Bot1 reveals the Llanowar Elves, there is simply no land to
# untap. The Passage is gone and 1 life paid; no land is on the battlefield.

[Bot1 Deck]
Elven Passage
Llanowar Elves
Ornithopter x5
Ornithopter x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Elven Passage.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Elven Passage.Activate
Bot1.Search()
Bot1.Choose(Llanowar Elves)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 19
Bot1.Graveyard = Elven Passage
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 0
Bot1.Revealed = Llanowar Elves
